# Fuzzer finding 0011: OCCT got the common part of this solid and the
# reference solid of test/occtworker.py wrong, so the symmetric
# difference came out at -12.5 mm3 of two equal solids.

sheet 2.286 0.8263 0.4145
plate base 0 0 174.4625 129.2657 origin -1.8797 19.1186 0 axes +z +y
flange f0 base +y -179.999 15.2402
flange f2 f0 -x -90 11.9419 span 135.2171 146.7268
hole 3.2349 -8.5002 145.6025 along z
